{"article":{"id":52154202993041,"url":"https://icewarp.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/52154202993041.json","html_url":"https://support.icewarp.com/hc/en-us/articles/52154202993041-Patch-and-mitigation-of-PHP-Vulnerabilities-CVE-2026-109618-CVE-2026-109619-and-CVE-2026-115560","author_id":370744548597,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":true,"position":0,"vote_sum":9,"vote_count":31,"upvote_count":20,"downvote_count":11,"section_id":19244172564113,"created_at":"2026-10-21T10:28:30Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T15:30:21Z","name":"Patch and mitigation of PHP Vulnerabilities CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619 and CVE-2026-115560","title":"Patch and mitigation of PHP Vulnerabilities CVE-2026-109618, CVE-2026-109619 and CVE-2026-115560","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-10-26T15:30:21Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":226468,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":[],"body":"<div>\n<strong>Applies to:</strong> IceWarp Server 14.3, 14.2, 14.1 and older versions</div><h2 id=\"h_01M5HG7SG572J11MWXQ62RR1XQ\"><strong>Summary</strong></h2><div>Vulnerabilities have been disclosed in PHP and are tracked as <strong>CVE-2026-109618,</strong> <strong>CVE-2026-109619 and CVE-2026-115560</strong>. IceWarp Server bundles PHP, so installations running an unpatched PHP version may be affected.<br>IceWarp is providing packages with a patched PHP for supported versions. Customers should apply the patch matching their IceWarp version and operating system as soon as possible.</div><div> </div><h2 id=\"h_01M5HG7SG6WSFM1R39FA6YK7KN\"><strong>Affected versions and available patches</strong></h2><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_9def39125b4b4879\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"off\"><div> </div></div><div dir=\"ltr\" id=\"model-response-message-contentr_9def39125b4b4879\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"off\"><figure class=\"wysiwyg-table\"><table style=\"border-color: rgb(31, 31, 31); border-width: 0px; margin-bottom: 32px;\" data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<thead><tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><strong>IceWarp Version</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><strong>Bundled PHP</strong></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><strong>Available Downloads / OS Support</strong></td>\n</tr></thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">EPOS Update 3</strong></div>\n<div>(14.3.0.X)</div>\n<div> </div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,1,1,0\">PHP 8.4</span></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><div>• <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.3.0.15_Windows_x64.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,1,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Windows</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.3.0.15_RHEL8_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,1,3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 8</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.3.0.15_RHEL9_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,1,3,4\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 9</a>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">EPOS Update 2</strong></div>\n<div>(14.2.0.X)</div>\n<div> </div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,2,1,0\">PHP 8.2</span></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><div>• <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.2.0.17_Windows_x64.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Windows</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.2.0.17_RHEL7_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 7</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.2.0.17_RHEL8_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,3,4\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 8</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.2.0.17_RHEL9_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,2,3,6\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 9</a>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">EPOS Update 1</strong></div>\n<div>(14.1.0.X)</div>\n<div> </div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,3,1,0\">PHP 8.2</span></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><div>• <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.1.0.23_Windows_x64.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Windows</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.1.0.23_RHEL7_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 7</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.1.0.23_RHEL8_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,3,4\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 8</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.1.0.23_RHEL9_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,3,3,6\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 9</a>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">EPOS</strong></div>\n<div>(14.0.0.X)</div>\n<div> </div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,4,1,0\">PHP 7.3</span></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><div>• <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.0.x_Windows_x86.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,4,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Windows</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.0.0.18_RHEL7_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,4,3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 7</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-14.0.0.18_RHEL8_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,4,3,4\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 8</a>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\">\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Deep Castle 2</strong></div>\n<div><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Update 3</strong></div>\n<div>(13.0.3.X)</div>\n<div> </div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><span data-path-to-node=\"1,5,1,0\">PHP 7.3</span></td>\n<td style=\"border-color: rgb(196, 199, 197); padding: 8px 12px;\"><div>• <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-13.0.3_Windows_x86.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,5,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Windows</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-13.0.3.13_RHEL7_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,5,3,2\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 7</a> • <a href=\"https://cdnfiles.icewarp.com/patches/php/new/php-13.0.3.13_RHEL8_x64.tar.gz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-path-to-node=\"1,5,3,4\" data-index-in-node=\"2\">Red Hat 8</a>\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></figure></div><h2 id=\"h_01M5HGR8AW66A7TZM4VT7DFZ5N\"><strong>Installing the patched PHP</strong></h2><div id=\"gui.im.panels.room.main.tabs.room.list.mssg_32#border\"><div id=\"gui.im.panels.room.main.tabs.room.list.mssg_32#body\"><div>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYM9XCNXC9AC6YVWBB91\" data-path-to-node=\"3\">Step 1: Stop the IceWarp Control Service</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"4\">\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"eb11aa61f06b2a57655a7a839eb5a3978\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Linux:</strong></p>\n<div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjd-L7Srs2XAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQhwM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">/opt/icewarp/icewarpd.sh --stop control</code></pre></div></div></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ea1e0417569af8ed893bc059f6b030f8b\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"4,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Windows (Admin Command Prompt / PowerShell):</strong></p>\n<div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjd-L7Srs2XAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiAM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">net stop \"IceWarpControl\"</code></pre></div></div></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYMC3JV3PXHVQFYJH79G\" data-path-to-node=\"6\">Step 2: Backup Existing PHP Folder</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"7\">\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e5b91321330e94704712e4dbe8a39a275\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Linux:</strong></p>\n<div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjd-L7Srs2XAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQiQM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">mv /opt/icewarp/php /opt/icewarp/php-bak</code></pre></div></div></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e2d1c3eebc3628d8cecb67ddb48a10604\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Windows: </strong></p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\">Rename the <code data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">php</code> directory to <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">php-bak</code></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJPGAYSTV80DNWEXHW433J\" data-path-to-node=\"9\">Step 3: Deploy Patched PHP Folder</h3>\n<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"eb40e397dbbe5bb2ecb8e900fd911fb65\"><p data-path-to-node=\"10\">Copy your extracted, patched <code data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"29\">php</code> directory into <code data-path-to-node=\"10\" data-index-in-node=\"48\">[icewarp-installdir]/php</code>.</p></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYMFDKXWVVKAXXAAKKV3\" data-path-to-node=\"12\">Step 4: Restore Configuration Files</h3>\n<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e3ae5a05bf0b863a07c293d288340b5ad\"><p data-path-to-node=\"13\">Copy <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"5\">php.ini</code> and <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"17\">php.user.ini</code> from <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"35\">php-bak/</code> into the new <code data-path-to-node=\"13\" data-index-in-node=\"57\">php/</code> folder:</p></li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYMJNRCB6RWE7GCE76CT\" data-path-to-node=\"16\">Step 5: Restore Temporary Files</h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6fa78369655bc8f7cffdd2639aee7545\"><p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong>Linux</strong>: Copy the contents of <code data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">php-bak/tmp/</code> into <code data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">php/tmp/</code></p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eada05724f349ccb7aa78ad0f8111833b\"><p data-path-to-node=\"17\"><strong>Windows: </strong>Copy the contents of <code data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"21\">php-bak/temp/</code> into <code data-path-to-node=\"17\" data-index-in-node=\"39\">php/temp/</code></p></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYMN6CQ9AYHJ73ZKN3ZP\" data-path-to-node=\"20\">Step 6: Fix File Permissions (Linux Only)</h3>\n<ul><li data-list-item-id=\"e00f70c874492cdf998ad08799c6ea565\">\n<strong>Linux only:</strong> Run <code>chown</code> on the new <code>php</code> folder so that its ownership matches the rest of the IceWarp installation. (for example: <code data-path-to-node=\"23\" data-index-in-node=\"112\">chown -R icewarp:icewarp /opt/icewarp/php</code>).</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"h_01M5HJAYMQ6NZ8PXVE8VE77DS4\" data-path-to-node=\"25\">Step 7: Restart the IceWarp Control Service</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"26\">\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e7d09e334f59957dd2ea29ed7b67bbb74\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"26,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Linux:</strong></p>\n<div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjd-L7Srs2XAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQkAM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">/opt/icewarp/icewarpd.sh --restart control</code></pre></div></div></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ed12412b64021a37c304e4b97ddc37977\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"26,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"26,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Windows:</strong></p>\n<div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwjd-L7Srs2XAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQkQM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">net stop \"IceWarpControl\" &amp; net start \"IceWarpControl\"</code></pre></div></div></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div></div><h3 id=\"h_01M5HG7SGCK1RVZ0JAPHSHHYCQ\">Step 8: Mitigation of Vulnerability CVE-2026-115560</h3><ul><li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"ef6c4e9f9bf8f273ecafba963495f3be0\"><p data-path-to-node=\"47,1,0\"><strong>Regarding this recently disclosed vulnerability, please apply the following configuration again in </strong><code><strong>php.ini</strong></code><strong>:</strong></p></li></ul><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eb6b6695f17dd702db88eb9d4a3280c5c\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\">Backup the <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">php.ini</code> file located in <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">/icewarp/php/</code></p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e448abdffd76ca24e2076fa57d9fd53ed\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\">Open the <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">php.ini</code> file using a text editor.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eeaef72e5e3c97a477615c7ab7e8f0a28\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,1,0\">Locate the variable stated below.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e12f22c8eda27ade4012feb1edd63fb24\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\">If the variable is commented out (starts with a semicolon <code data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">;</code>), <strong data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">remove the semicolon</strong>.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2f29e4f6b8d277a1588ca6698bde2cf9\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,3,0\">Set the variable to the specific value</p></li>\n</ol><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">session.upload_progress.enabled=0</code></pre><ul><li class=\"wysiwyg-list-bold\" data-list-item-id=\"e97a89cb8df5f81223c8045c8b4c140a2\">\n<strong>Create the </strong><code data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"19\"><strong>php.user.ini</strong></code><strong> override file:</strong>\n</li></ul><ol data-path-to-node=\"47\">\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eebb415ccd7743865d679b682bfd9ecfe\"><p data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\">In the same directory (<code data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">/icewarp/php/</code>), create a new text file named <code data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">php.user.ini</code>.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ef557868750bf02b7f987bfc8e0674570\"><p data-path-to-node=\"47,1,0\">Add the following lines to the file and save it:</p></li>\n</ol><div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwid4vmr1MiXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0gM\"><div><div><pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">session.upload_progress.enabled = 0</code></pre></div></div></div><h2 id=\"h_01M5W3JZM2ANA1985XYVJRSBQN\"> </h2><h2 id=\"h_01M5W3JZM21Z9H80R864QH2FKS\"><strong>Permanent fix in future releases</strong></h2><div>Future IceWarp releases will include the patched PHP by default:</div><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e2ea8af1bfee268c22926828a4d45d4f2\">\n<strong>IceWarp 14.3.0.14</strong> and later</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea67c36fd1891a678af23939062f7d5a1\">\n<strong>IceWarp 14.2.0.17</strong> and later</li>\n</ul><div>Customers who upgrade to these versions or newer do not need to install the patch packages separately.</div><h2 id=\"h_01M5HG7SGDYWZQQFF3X08HMHWS\"><strong>Older versions:</strong></h2><div>IceWarp versions older than 13.0.2 The PHP project has not yet released an official patch for this branch, so no patched package can be provided.<br>As a partial measure, we continue to recommend changing the following settings in <code>php.ini</code>:</div><pre id=\"code_11619801606173200000\"><code class=\"language-auto\">session.upload_progress.enabled = 0\nmemory_limit = -1\npost_max_size = 32M\nupload_max_filesize = 32M\nsession.serialize_handler = php</code></pre><blockquote>\n<div>\n<strong>Important:</strong> These settings do <strong>not</strong> fully mitigate the vulnerabilities. Customers running older versions are strongly advised to upgrade to a newer version of IceWarp and apply the patches listed above.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #C72809;\">!!! The changes above will limit the upload limit of files to 32 MB !!!</span></div>\n</blockquote><div> </div><h2 id=\"h_01M5HG7SGEYFNCBXP7NXG5N0K7\"><strong>Recommended actions</strong></h2><h3 id=\"h_01M5HHNB9F996S1M3NDD1V1D75\">Modify the primary <code data-path-to-node=\"42\" data-index-in-node=\"27\">php.ini</code> file</h3><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e235cb6f21839966cb9929f1a5d1b0c5c\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\">Backup the <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">php.ini</code> file located in <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"33\">/icewarp/php/</code></p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e4757b9784e9cb44eb753b8f25a6e2a87\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\">Open the <code data-path-to-node=\"43,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"9\">php.ini</code> file using a text editor.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7e16c1fc67f4a46e3e3a5da24ad30319\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,1,0\">Locate the variables stated below.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8cf5f2b9d35df0ac6ef496f77443733c\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\">If any of the variables are commented out (starts with a semicolon <code data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"54\">;</code>), <strong data-path-to-node=\"43,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"58\">remove the semicolon</strong>.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e69fc415f0ff198f6b869806f48f50824\"><p data-path-to-node=\"43,3,0\">Set the variables to their specific value</p></li>\n</ol><h3 id=\"h_01M5FHDZR59MPPZ5A8T5NK3319\" data-path-to-node=\"46\">Create the <code data-path-to-node=\"46\" data-index-in-node=\"19\">php.user.ini</code> override file</h3><ol data-path-to-node=\"47\">\n<li data-list-item-id=\"edfea0ae2b2bbeadc56f82306dc7568c1\"><p data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\">In the same directory (<code data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"23\">/icewarp/php/</code>), create a new text file named <code data-path-to-node=\"47,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"68\">php.user.ini</code>.</p></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e51c0a5a68983fe360d9688cb79d6b0b0\"><p data-path-to-node=\"47,1,0\">Add the following lines to the file and save it:</p></li>\n</ol><div data-hveid=\"0\" data-ved=\"0CAAQhtANahgKEwid4vmr1MiXAxUAAAAAHQAAAAAQ0gM\"><div><div>\n<pre><code class=\"language-auto\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">session.upload_progress.enabled = 0\nmemory_limit = -1\npost_max_size = 32M\nupload_max_filesize = 32M\nsession.serialize_handler = php</code></pre>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span style=\"color: #C72809;\">If you are already on the patched version, you can revert the changes above to the original state.</span></p>\n<p><code>session.upload_progress.enabled = 0</code> - <span style=\"color: #C72809;\">Must remain in the files even on patched version.</span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</blockquote>\n</div></div></div>"}}